    "Id": "chassisdef_caracara_CAR-4",
    "Name": "Caracara",
    "Details": "The Caracara 4 is focused on improving the damage area by mounting only a LB-X AC/20 and a Hyper-Assault/30 Gauss Rifle, but both configured for optimal clustering. The LB-X does have two tons of AP ammo if clustering is not desired.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
